# Read AGENTS.md First

At the start of any work on this project, **read AGENTS.md** (project root).

AGENTS.md is the single source of project context, mission structure, Eden callouts, GUI conventions, implemented patterns, and guidelines. Following it ensures edits stay consistent and leverage existing best practices.
